# Add new changelog entries following the format below.
# Add newest entries to the top of the list.
# Separate entries from eachother with a blank line.

# * date Author's Name <author's email> version-release
# - Summary of changes

* Sun Mar 16 2025 Fredrik Axling <faxling11@gmail.com> 1.5.3
- Ver 1.5.3
- Add display of live AIS vessels in map
- Fix broken seacharts / sonar
- Exit application when power less 5 % saves track then
- Save marker with name from searchresult
- Buggfixing for track loading/ unloading


* Sun Mar 16 2025 Fredrik Axling <faxling11@gmail.com> 1.5.2
- Ver 1.5.2
- Add wind and temerature (m/s and deg c) indication to crosshair
- Add option for edit pike length to avoid accidental editing
- Add options in settings page for turning crosshair options on anf off
- Fix bugg turning compass on and off
- Smother map panning
- Handle switching map source to sea charts when offline

* Fri Oct 18 2024 Fredrik Axling <faxling11@gmail.com> 1.5.1
- Ver 1.5.1
- Fix broken sea charts. Key length to long overflow
- Add depth indication in sea charts

* Thu Aug 15 2024 Fredrik Axling <faxling11@gmail.com> 1.5.0
- Ver 1.5.0
- Use libcurl instead of libsoup for downloading tiles. Betters performance
- Fix broken sea charts.
- Add google maps options
. Fix bug calculation total length
- Filter function for markers
- Fix image rotation for sharing to Telegram etc

